                      (ration/src/main.s):02002         ; read_joystick — sample right X/Y and resolve a four-way requested direction.
                      (ration/src/main.s):02003         ;
                      (ration/src/main.s):02004         ; Inputs:
                      (ration/src/main.s):02005         ;   None
                      (ration/src/main.s):02006         ;
                      (ration/src/main.s):02007         ; Returns:
