CA1E 8680             (ration/src/main.s):02024                 lda     #$80
CA20 B7FF20           (ration/src/main.s):02025                 sta     PIA2_DA
                      (ration/src/main.s):02026         
CA23 9601             (ration/src/main.s):02027                 lda     JOY_X
CA25 8020             (ration/src/main.s):02028                 suba    #32
